# Decision Ledger: Index

Purpose:
  Decision ledger for SDDRA. Every human and AI decision gets a written record.

Structure:
  .sdd/
  ├── decisions/
  │   ├── INDEX.sdd (root index)
  │   ├── schema.sdd (decision schema)
  │   ├── template.sdd (decision template)
  │   ├── workflow.sdd (decision lifecycle)
  │   ├── rules.sdd (decision rules)
  │   ├── task-lifecycle.sdd (decision-task mapping)
  │   ├── integration.sdd (chain integration)
  │   ├── decisions.sdd (ledger overview)
  │   └── project/
  │       ├── INDEX.sdd (project decision index)
  │       ├── DEC-XXX.sdd (concrete decisions)
  │       └── task-map.sdd (decision-to-task mapping)

Principle:
  > If it's not in the decision ledger, it didn't happen.

Files:
  Root: @INDEX.sdd
  Schema: @schema.sdd
  Template: @template.sdd
  Workflow: @workflow.sdd
  Rules: @rules.sdd
  TaskLifecycle: @task-lifecycle.sdd
  Integration: @integration.sdd
  Overview: @decisions.sdd
  ProjectIndex: @project/INDEX.sdd
  ProjectDecisions: @project/*.sdd
  TaskMap: @project/task-map.sdd

State: +
